{
  "$comment": "The person attributes Rock ships that the sample data fills, and the Date Engaged attribute the loader adds (decisions 250 to 258). rockAttributes lists every Rock person attribute the sample data reads or writes, or that a Cast file holds, by key and Guid. Every load checks that Rock has each one under its key, and cast/validate-cast.js checks that every Cast attribute key is one of them, a staff attribute, or Date Engaged. castLoaded names the keys the loader writes from Cast files. Allergy has its own writer (decision 211), BaptismDate and BaptizedHere come from the Baptism step, and the rest a Cast file holds wait for their own work: FirstVisit and SecondVisit for Rock's Family Analytics (issue 11), BackgroundCheckDate and BackgroundCheckResult for the background checks connection requests make, and the DISC results for assessments (issue 3). The Cast gets no drawn employer, school, note, visit, or allergy: its stories are written by hand. Those rules fill generated people only, each from its own seeded stream. Ability Level, Date Engaged, and envelopes follow everyone's records, the Cast's too.",
